  "issues": {
    "token_expiring": {
      "title": "Anycubic token expires in {days} days",
      "description": "The token for **{name}** expires in about **{days} days**. Anycubic tokens last 90 days and can't be renewed automatically, so Home Assistant will lose access when it lapses.\n\n**1. Get a fresh token** with the one-click helper for your computer. Each one only reads a value your computer has already saved — nothing is sent anywhere.\n\n- [Mac — double-click this]({tool_macos})\n- [Windows — PowerShell one-liner]({tool_windows})\n- [Any browser — bookmarklet]({tool_browser})\n\n**2. [Open the integration]({reauth_url})** → ⋮ → **Reconfigure** → **Re-Auth**.\n\n**3. Paste it in.** You don't need to tidy it up or pick a type — it's worked out for you."
    }
  }
